                mt-2
                text-xs
                leading-6
                font-medium
                text-slate-400
              "
            >
              These settings only describe how versions should be
              compared. Saving a rule does not modify, restore,
              publish, rollback or release any entity version.
            </p>

          </div>

        </div>

      </div>


